{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《夫妻的博弈》正式踏入結局周，日前播出一集，飾演雪文（Sherman）的郭柏妍迎來極具挑戰性的虐心戲份。她在劇中不幸失足導致胎兒不保，其崩潰爆喊的破格演出，獲大批觀眾激讚演技大躍進。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d0ca0f27-985f-4f92-a5ea-ed86accce910.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026VAYSpOCkA01788237948.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d0ca0f27-985f-4f92-a5ea-ed86accce910.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇情講述 Sherman 不慎失足流產，大受打擊的她竟然借意將失去 BB 的責任嫁禍到幸如（高海寧飾）身上。不過謊言最終被其親母沈淑冰（黎燕珊飾）當眾拆穿，令 Sherman 陷入絕望邊緣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">最令觀眾揪心的一幕，莫過於 Sherman 在醫院得知痛失胎兒後的真實反應。她情緒激動地不斷反問醫生：「你Check清楚未呀？」更崩潰得掩着耳朵，拒絕接受這個殘忍的事實。Rosita 完美演繹出失去親生骨肉的撕心裂肺，令觀眾睇到極度心噏。隨後一幕，她在房內獨自對住一堆 BB 用品，緊緊攬着 BB 鞋難過落淚，場面令人鼻酸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"22bddcf2-c270-498a-86e8-1f7fe0b8c27f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026tmAyUUZeAH1788237948.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"22bddcf2-c270-498a-86e8-1f7fe0b8c27f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這兩場超催淚的虐心戲播出後，郭柏妍的亮眼表現火速引發網民熱議。大批觀眾紛紛留言大讚她對情緒拿捏得相當準確：「Rosita 喺呢套劇嘅表現真係幾好」、「冇咗 BB 嗰幕我都睇到眼濕濕」、「Rosita 啲戲真係進步咗好多」！</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">談到這幕備受讚賞的痛失胎兒戲，郭柏妍接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 獨家訪問時坦言印象非常深刻：「拍完之後我都有好心痛嘅感覺，我都唔知自己喊咗幾耐，感覺好辛苦。我記得嗰排特登睇好多 BB 嘢，社交平台一開全部都係有關 BB 嘅資訊，令自己更加代入做媽媽嘅感覺。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bfe62014-5189-4638-a33e-b21f86b4c790.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20261Odau6mqYL1788237948.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bfe62014-5189-4638-a33e-b21f86b4c790.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">她剖白指擁有 BB 令雪文這個角色成長了不少：「佢一直都好想要個屋企，因為佢來自單親家庭又冇屋企人，『家』對佢嚟講係非常重要。所以當佢失去嘅時候，係非常痛心，又內疚自己令到個 BB 冇咗。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">郭柏妍續指在房內收拾 BB 用品的一幕同樣令她心痛不已：「當我摸到 BB 嘅床、鞋同衫嘅時候，已經好容易進入角色嘅情緒，我直頭係喊到鼻水都流埋出嚟。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T05:19:45.297094+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":761,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}